-Last updated: 2026-07-18. Official sources reviewed within the narrow boundaries stated on this page.
+If a key date cannot be confirmed, choose one of three actions: wait for official confirmation; seek another official centre for the same accepted product; or ask the mission what its current instruction permits. Do not choose “assume the quickest outcome.” Record why you chose the action and when it must be revisited.
