+## Mistakes to avoid
+
+- Using a provider overview as a local result or certificate commitment.
+- Planning a visa appointment around an exam seat alone.
+- Treating a centre’s old calendar as a current booking offer.
+- Converting an unconfirmed backup attempt into a deadline.
+- Mixing a mission document deadline with a centre administrative deadline.
+- Forgetting that travel, spelling and identification are separate practical dependencies.
