+## Scenario: a friend says an exception applies
+
+An exception may be fact-specific and a general page cannot decide it. Record the fact your friend relies on, locate the mission’s current instruction, and ask whether that fact changes the language-proof requirement for your route. Do not book an exam merely to “be safe” if it may not be needed, but do not claim an exemption because a different applicant had one.
 
