+## Key decisions
+
+First decide which route and authority own the file. For the general settlement permit, Section 9 of the Residence Act is a national-law reference; for general naturalisation, Section 10 of the Nationality Act is a national-law reference. Neither page converts this checklist into an individual legal conclusion, and neither replaces a local procedure, form, authority contact or current document instruction.
