-## Make one fee record before comparing options
+A published price does not prove a live session, a seat, successful registration, a payment deadline, a refund right, a result date, or certificate delivery. Before money moves, save the booking result and the current rules owned by the selected centre. A price-page screenshot alone is not a booking confirmation.
 
