+
+Store the exact product, official path to the selected centre, category definition, evidence request, fee and currency, payment recipient or channel, cancellation and rescheduling terms, result/certificate route, and checked date. Keep payment and identity records private. A complete pack makes conflicts visible; it does not guarantee acceptance, a refund, a seat, a result date or an immigration outcome.
