+### Start with the certificate document you need
+
+Save your receiving authority’s exact instruction, including its route and document format. If it says only “B1”, ask whether the exact product and your proposed certificate documents fit. A passed Goethe module is not automatically the complete set of evidence your authority needs. A telc results sheet recording an unsuccessful examination is not the pass certificate.
+
